<div class="grid grid--2-8-2 ">
  <div class="cell">
    
<div class="article-intro">
  <a class="article-anchor" id="intro-driving-with-a-foreign-driving-licence" data-label="Intro"></a>
    <h1 class="article-intro__title ">
    Driving with a foreign driving licence
  </h1>

  <div class="page-intro rte">
    
    <p>Are you relocating to the Netherlands with a foreign driving licence? You can continue to use it for some time. Exactly how long, depends on the country that issued it.</p>
  </div>

</div>
      <div class="panel-group panel-group--default">
    


  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-10afcd50-b46c-45c6-bf38-a7ce3766c80b"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Driving licence issued in EU EFTA country
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-10afcd50-b46c-45c6-bf38-a7ce3766c80b"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>Do you have a driving licence issued in one of the countries of the&nbsp;<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden." title="Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden.">      European Union (EU)      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>&nbsp;or the&nbsp;<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland." title="Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland.">      European Free Trade Association (EFTA)      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>&nbsp;and do you now live in the Netherlands? You may continue to drive in the Netherlands with this licence for&nbsp;<strong>another 15 years</strong>&nbsp;(from the date of issue of the foreign driving licence).<br>
This applies to the following categories:</p>
<ul>
    <li>AM</li>
    <li>A1</li>
    <li>A2</li>
    <li>A</li>
    <li>B</li>
    <li>BE</li>
</ul>
<p>This is subject to the validity of the driving licence.</p>
<p>You may continue to drive in the Netherlands with the following categories for a maximum of five years from the date of issue of the licence:</p>
<ul>
    <li>C1</li>
    <li>C</li>
    <li>D1</li>
    <li>D</li>
    <li>C1E</li>
    <li>CE</li>
    <li>D1E</li>
    <li>DE</li>
</ul>
<p>This is subject to the validity of the driving licence.</p>
<p>Was your driving licence issued more than 15 years ago without having expired in the meantime? You may continue to use it for&nbsp;<strong>another 2 years</strong>&nbsp;after the date of your relocation to the Netherlands.</p>
<h3>Example</h3>
<p>You have been living in the Netherlands since 15 June 2024 and hold an EU driving licence issued on 1 January 2019.<br>
You may operate vehicles in categories AM, A1, A2, A, B and BE until 1 January 2034, provided these categories on your licence are still valid.<br>
<br>
For the categories C1, C, D1, D, C1E, CE, D1E and DE, you were permitted to drive until 1 January 2024. Because you have been living in the Netherlands after that date, you may continue to use your driving licence for another two years, until 15 June 2026, provided the categories on your licence are still valid.</p>
<h3>After this period</h3>
<p>After this period, you must hold a Dutch driving licence. This means you will need to exchange your foreign driving licence for a Dutch one.<span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;"></span></p>
<p class="message message__inline message__info" role="alert" aria-hidden="false"><strong>Apply for an exchange in time</strong><br>
Do you wish to continue driving in the Netherlands after 15 or 5 years? If so, you will need a Dutch driving licence. Apply for the <a href="/en/driving-licence/foreign-driving-licence/exchanging-a-foreign-driving-licence" class="anchor--internal-link">exchange&nbsp;to a Dutch driving licence</a>&nbsp;in good time. Without a Dutch driving licence, you will no longer be permitted to drive after that period, even if your application for exchange is still being processed. Please keep in mind that we need at least 15 working days to process your application. If we require further information, the application will take longer.<br>
<br>
</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>



  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-55e75c82-d371-4aa2-8b57-1a92a0f22972"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Driving licence issued in EU or EFTA after registration in the Netherlands
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-55e75c82-d371-4aa2-8b57-1a92a0f22972"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>Do you have a driving licence from 1 of the&nbsp;<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden." title="Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus (only the Greek part, not the Turkish part), Czechia, Denmark, Germany, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Netherlands, Poland, Portugal, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia, Spain and Sweden.">      European Union (EU)      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland." title="Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland.">      European Free Trade Association (EFTA)      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>&nbsp;countries and was this licence issued while you were living in the Netherlands? If so, you are not allowed to drive in the Netherlands with your foreign driving licence. You will have to exchange this licence. You can apply to the municipality where you are registered. The municipality will forward your application to us.</p>
<p>Please consult&nbsp;<a href="/en/driving-licence/foreign-driving-licence/exchanging-a-foreign-driving-licence" class="anchor--internal-link">Exchanging a foreign driving licence</a>.</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>



  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-722c7959-fc98-459d-a5f4-e9a1289927f7"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Driving licence issued outside the EU or EFTA
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-722c7959-fc98-459d-a5f4-e9a1289927f7"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>If you have a valid driving licence that was issued in a country outside the&nbsp;<span class="tooltip" role="tooltip">  <dfn class="tooltip__definition" data-tooltip-html="&lt;button class=&quot;tooltip__close&quot; aria-label=&quot;Close&quot;&gt;   &lt;svg role=&quot;presentation&quot; class=&quot;icn tooltip__icon tooltip__icon--close&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;      &lt;use href=&quot;/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-close&quot;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland." title="Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway and Switzerland.">      EU/EFTA      <svg role="presentation" class="icn tooltip__icon" width="18" height="18" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-question-mark"></use>      </svg>      <span class="tooltip__content" role="status"></span>  </dfn></span>, you may continue to use it for the first 185 days after you relocated to the Netherlands. After that period, you are only allowed to drive in the Netherlands with a Dutch driving licence. If the categories on your foreign driving licence do not have the designations A, B, C, D, E, it is wise to obtain an international driving licence in addition to your foreign one. You can get the international driving licence in the country that issued your current licence.</p>
<p>In some cases, you can exchange the foreign driving licence for a Dutch licence. Please consult Exchanging a foreign driving licence. In all other cases, you will have to retake the theory and practical test at the CBR.<span style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;"></span></p>
<p class="message message__inline message__info" role="alert" aria-hidden="false"><strong>Apply for an exchange in time</strong><br>
Do you wish to drive in the Netherlands for longer than 185 days? You may only do so with a Dutch driving licence. You may be able to <a href="/en/driving-licence/foreign-driving-licence/exchanging-a-foreign-driving-licence" class="anchor--internal-link">exchange your driving licence</a>&nbsp;for a Dutch one. Please apply for this in good time. We need at least 15 working days to process your application. You must also apply for a <a href="https://www.cbr.nl/nl/rijden-en-uw-gezondheid/nl/gezondheidsverklaring" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: medical certificate from the CBR"><span class="link__title">medical certificate from the CBR</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a>. This application also takes time. After 185 days, you are no longer permitted to drive without a Dutch driving licence, even if your application is already being processed.</p>
<h3>
Driving licence from Ukraine
</h3>
<p>If you have a driving licence from Ukraine and are covered by the Temporary Protection Directive (residence permit 46), you may continue to drive in the Netherlands with your driving licence.
</p>
<p>Even if the driving licence has expired. You can only exchange it for a Dutch driving licence with a 30% ruling from the Dutch tax authority. For more information, please consult&nbsp;<a href="https://www.rijksoverheid.nl/onderwerpen/opvang-vluchtelingen-uit-oekraine/aankomst-verblijf-en-registratie" class="link link--primary link--external" aria-label="This is an external link: Driving with a licence from Ukraine"><span class="link__title">Driving with a licence from Ukraine</span><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" class="icn link__icn link__icn--right" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
    <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-external"></use>
</svg></a>.&nbsp;
</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>



  <div class="panel panel--default " >
    <h2 class="panel__title">
      <button class="panel__trigger"
  aria-controls="panel-b69b92ff-2d80-4183-9a46-dc8746b2bc60"                     aria-expanded="false">
        
        Tourist in the Netherlands
        <svg role="presentation"
             class="icn panel__trigger__icn"
             width="12"
             height="8"
             focusable="false"
             aria-hidden="true">
          <title></title>
          <use href="/assets/Shared/svg/sprite.svg?v=20261016.2-a3459ab#icon-expand-more"></use>
        </svg>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div id="panel-b69b92ff-2d80-4183-9a46-dc8746b2bc60"
         class="panel__content panel--default__content"
         role="region"
         aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rte"><p>If you are in the Netherlands as a tourist, and not as a resident, you may drive in the Netherlands with your foreign driving licence.
</p>
<p>Was your driving licence issued by a country outside the EU/EFTA? The categories on your driving licence must be A, B, C, D, E. If the categories on your driving licence have different designations, it is wise to obtain an international driving licence in addition to your foreign one. You can get the international driving licence in the country that issued your current licence.</p></div>
      
    </div>
  </div>

  </div>

    
  </div>
</div>

  </main>

    <div class="footer-wrapper">
    <div class="grid grid--2-8-2">
      <div class="cell">
        

<section class="csat-form unprintable">
  <div class="csat-form__main">
    <form class="csat-form__form">
      <fieldset class="csat-form__score"
                aria-hidden="false"
                aria-expanded="true">
        <legend>
          <h2 class="csat-form__score__title">Has this information helped you?</h2>
        </legend>
        <ol class="csat-form__radio-list">
            <li class="csat-form__radio">
              <input id="csat-score-1" class="csat-form__input" type="radio" value="1" name="csat-score">
              <label for="csat-score-1" class="csat-form__label" aria-label="no: This information did not help me well">
                <span class="csat-form__rating">no</span>
              </label>
            </li>
            <li class="csat-form__radio">
              <input id="csat-score-2" class="csat-form__input" type="radio" value="2" name="csat-score">
              <label for="csat-score-2" class="csat-form__label" aria-label="a little: This information helped me somewhat">
                <span class="csat-form__rating">a little</span>
              </label>
            </li>
            <li class="csat-form__radio">
              <input id="csat-score-3" class="csat-form__input" type="radio" value="3" name="csat-score">
              <label for="csat-score-3" class="csat-form__label" aria-label="neutral: I am satisfied with this information">
                <span class="csat-form__rating">neutral</span>
              </label>
            </li>
            <li class="csat-form__radio">
              <input id="csat-score-4" class="csat-form__input" type="radio" value="4" name="csat-score">
              <label for="csat-score-4" class="csat-form__label" aria-label="yes: This information helped me well">
                <span class="csat-form__rating">yes</span>
              </label>
            </li>
            <li class="csat-form__radio">
              <input id="csat-score-5" class="csat-form__input" type="radio" value="5" name="csat-score">
              <label for="csat-score-5" class="csat-form__label" aria-label="very much: This information helped me very well">
                <span class="csat-form__rating">very much</span>
              </label>
            </li>
        </ol>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset aria-hidden="true" class="csat-form__feedback" aria-expanded="false" aria-live="assertive">
        <legend>
          Would you like to tell us more about this? (optional)
        </legend>
        <label for="csat-feedback-textarea" class="csat-form__feedback-label">
          We use your feedback to improve the website.
        </label>
        <textarea id="csat-feedback-textarea"></textarea>
        <div class="rte csat-feedback__info">
          <p><strong>Important<br>
</strong><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">Please do not enter personal information such as your name, address, or vehicle registration number. We do not answer questions here.<br>
</span><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.012em; word-spacing: 0.016em;">Need help?&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.192px; word-spacing: 0.256px;"><a href="/en/contact" class="anchor--internal-link">Contact us</a>.</span></p>
        </div>
        <button class="csat-form__btn csat-form__btn--send">
          Send
        </button>
      </fieldset>
    </form>

      <div class="csat-form__questionnaire"
           role="status"
           aria-live="polite"
           aria-hidden="true"
           aria-expanded="false">
        <h2>Thank you for your feedback!</h2>
        <div class="rte csat-form__questionnaire__info"><p>With your help we can improve our website</p></div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
    </div>
